---
layout: base.njk
title: Publications
permalink: /publications/
pageJs: /assets/js/filter.js
description: Publications by Greig Oldford, including journal articles, preprints, software, book chapters and reports.
---
{% set types = [["all","All"],["peer","Peer-reviewed"],["review","In review & preprints"],["software","Software & data"],["other","Reports & other"]] %}
<header class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Publications</p>
    <h1 class="display display--xl">Papers, software &amp; reports</h1>
    <p class="lead">Peer-reviewed papers, open models and software, and technical reports that support fisheries and oceans management. My name is in bold. For citation metrics see <a href="{{ site.links.orcid }}">ORCID</a>{% if site.links.scholar %} or <a href="{{ site.links.scholar }}">Google Scholar</a>{% endif %}.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="filterbar" data-filter="publist">
      <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Filter by type">
        {% for t in types %}
        <button type="button" data-type="{{ t[0] }}" aria-pressed="{{ 'true' if t[0] == 'all' else 'false' }}">{{ t[1] }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <label class="search"><span class="sr-only">Search publications</span><input type="search" placeholder="Search titles, authors, journals" data-search></label>
    </div>
    <div id="publist">
    {% for y in publications | uniqueYears("year") %}
      <div class="yeargroup" data-group>
        <h2 class="yeargroup__year mono">{{ y }}</h2>
        <ol class="publist">
          {% for p in publications | where("year", y) %}{% include "pub.njk" %}{% endfor %}
        </ol>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="muted pubs__more">Much of my work also lives outside journals: in open ocean and ecosystem models, in advice to management and in expert testimony. See <a href="/research/#code">code and models</a> and <a href="/talks/">talks and testimony</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
